{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29427","headline":"无题 · 李商隐","name":"无题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"照梁初有情，出水旧知名。\n帬衩芙蓉小，钗茸翡翠轻。\n锦长书郑重，眉细恨分明。\n莫近弹碁局，中心最不平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29427.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29427","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》卷五三九、《唐诗鉴赏辞典》李商隐条（上海辞书出版社，1983）、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）"}